{
 "slug": "home",
 "pt_slug": "inicio",
 "main": "<main id=\"main\">\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     HERO\n==================================================================== -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hero-panel\">\n\n<!-- Backlight for the WHOLE hero. FOUR INDEPENDENT LAYERS, each its own\n     element so it can be nudged on its own. Every position lives in\n     css/hero.css under BACKLIGHT, as custom properties on the element:\n       --x  horizontal centre, % of the panel\n       --y  vertical centre,   % of the panel\n       --w  width,             % of the panel (height follows the artwork)\n       --o  opacity\n     Moving one glow means changing one line.\n\n     This sits FIRST in the panel and carries no z-index of its own, so the\n     glows paint behind the copy column (z-index:1) and behind the dashboard\n     stage by DOM order -- while still being individually raisable via the\n     editor's Depth control. See the note in css/hero.css. -->\n<div class=\"hero-glows\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-1\" src=\"assets/img/glow-1-left-blue.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-2\" src=\"assets/img/glow-2-top-magenta.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-3\" src=\"assets/img/glow-3-right-violet.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-4\" src=\"assets/img/glow-4-bottomright-purple.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-1 dup-1\" src=\"assets/img/glow-1-left-blue.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hero-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     CURVAS DE BRILHO DO HERO — ancoradas ao LAYOUT, n&atilde;o a um viewBox fixo.\n\n     POR QUE ISSO MUDOU (2026-07-30): elas ficavam num &uacute;nico\n     <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1300 760\" preserveAspectRatio=\"slice\"> do painel inteiro. O slice escala\n     por max(W/1300, H/760) — e QUAL desses dois termos vence muda conforme a\n     propor&ccedil;&atilde;o do painel muda. Quando muda, o corte troca de eixo e\n     todas as curvas pulam. Enquanto isso, o dashboard &eacute; montado pelo grid do CSS\n     em pixels reais, ent&atilde;o os dois nunca se acompanharam e se desalinhavam em\n     cada largura de tela. Por isso as linhas &ldquo;se mexiam para todo lado&rdquo;.\n\n     Agora cada curva &eacute; um simples <img> posicionado em PORCENTAGENS da caixa a que\n     pertence, ent&atilde;o ela escala com essa caixa e com mais nada:\n       .hero-fx   — ocupa o painel. Cont&eacute;m as curvas 2 e 4, presas &agrave;\n                    borda esquerda e ao canto inferior direito do painel.\n       .stage-fx  — ocupa a coluna do dashboard. Cont&eacute;m as curvas 1 e 3, que\n                    pertencem &agrave; placa e precisam ficar fixas em rela&ccedil;&atilde;o a ela.\n     As porcentagens foram convertidas dos n&uacute;meros do viewBox antigo na largura\n     de projeto; os valores est&atilde;o em css/hero.css. -->\n<div class=\"hero-grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"hero-copy\" data-reveal>\n\n    <h1>Gerencie o seu neg&oacute;cio na Amazon com <span class=\"grad-text\">confian&ccedil;a.</span></h1>\n\n    <p class=\"hero-sub\">Tudo conectado. Tudo sincronizado.<br>Tome decis&otilde;es melhores, mais r&aacute;pido.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"#waitlist\" data-waitlist-open data-source=\"hero\" data-magnetic>\n        Entre na lista de espera <svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <ul class=\"ticks\">\n      <li><svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Acesso antecipado</li>\n      <li><svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Importe em minutos</li>\n      <li><svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Sem fidelidade</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-floats\">\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f1\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">Precis&atilde;o da previs&atilde;o</span>\n          <span class=\"float-delta\"><svg class=\"icon-sm\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg>8%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-value\">94%</div>\n        <svg class=\"float-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n          <path fill=\"url(#sparkFillGreen)\" d=\"@@T16@@\"/>\n          <path class=\"spark-line\" stroke=\"#2ED47A\" d=\"@@T17@@\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f2\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">ROAS</span>\n          <span class=\"float-delta\"><svg class=\"icon-sm\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg>14%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-value\">5.9x</div>\n        <svg class=\"float-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n          <path fill=\"url(#sparkFillBlue)\" d=\"@@T18@@\"/>\n          <path class=\"spark-line\" stroke=\"#7EB3FF\" d=\"@@T19@@\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f3\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">Lucro</span>\n          <span class=\"float-delta\"><svg class=\"icon-sm\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg>18%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-value\">+$18,240</div>\n        <svg class=\"float-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n          <path fill=\"url(#sparkFillPurple)\" d=\"@@T20@@\"/>\n          <path class=\"spark-line\" stroke=\"#A971F7\" d=\"@@T21@@\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f4\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">Estoque</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-inv\">\n          <span class=\"float-check\"><svg><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"float-value\" style=\"margin-top:0\">Seguro<small>42 dias</small></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ============================ DASHBOARD ============================ -->\n  <div class=\"hero-stage\" data-reveal>\n  <div class=\"hero-stage-inner\">\n\n  <!-- The dashboard is now the rendered artwork, cropped out of\n       Images/Dashboard.png. That source is a full UI-kit sheet — the card\n       itself occupies x 11..1103, y 54..827 of the 1536x1024 original, with a\n       colour-palette column to its right and a notes strip below; those are\n       cropped away in assets/img/dashboard.jpg (1097x778).\n\n       It is positioned ABSOLUTELY over .dash rather than replacing it. .dash\n       stays in the DOM (visibility:hidden, see css/dashboard.css) and keeps\n       defining the hero panel's height. That matters: every hero curve is\n       placed in viewBox units derived from the panel's dimensions, so letting\n       the image resize the panel would shift all four of them.\n\n       The 3D transform mirrors .dash exactly, so the slab tilts the same way\n       and reacts to hover the same way. -->\n  <!-- Backlight behind the dashboard. THREE INDEPENDENT LAYERS, each its own\n       element so it can be nudged on its own. Every position lives in\n       css/hero.css under BACKLIGHT, as custom properties on the element:\n         --x  horizontal centre, % of the stage\n         --y  vertical centre,   % of the stage\n         --w  width,             % of the stage (height follows the artwork)\n         --o  opacity\n       Moving one glow means changing one line. The defaults reproduce the\n       composition the four source files were drawn in. -->\n  <img class=\"dash-shot\" src=\"assets/img/dashboard.jpg\"\n       alt=\"Painel da AmazeBase mostrando faturamento, lucro, fluxo de caixa e estoque\"\n       width=\"1097\" height=\"778\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n  <div class=\"dash\" data-tilt>\n  <div class=\"dash-edge-b\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dash-edge-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dash-face\">\n\n    <div class=\"dash-bar\">\n      <span class=\"dash-brand\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M16 3.2 29 27.5h-6.4L16 14.1 9.4 27.5H3z\" fill=\"url(#markGrad)\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span data-brand>AmazeBase</span>\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"dash-bar-right\">\n        <span class=\"dash-chip\"><svg><use href=\"#i-calendar\"/></svg>Este m&ecirc;s</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-chip\"><svg><use href=\"#i-refresh\"/></svg>vs. m&ecirc;s anterior</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-chip\"><svg><use href=\"#i-export\"/></svg>Exportar</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-avatar\">MJ</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dash-body\">\n\n      <aside class=\"dash-side\">\n        <span class=\"dash-nav is-active\"><svg><use href=\"#i-grid\"/></svg>Vis&atilde;o geral</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-box\"/></svg>Produtos</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>Pesquisa</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-mega\"/></svg>Publicidade</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-stack\"/></svg>Estoque</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-calendar\"/></svg>Previs&atilde;o</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-dollar\"/></svg>Finan&ccedil;as</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-truck\"/></svg>Fornecedores</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-report\"/></svg>Relat&oacute;rios</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-spark\"/></svg>Assistente de IA</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-bell\"/></svg>Alertas</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-gear\"/></svg>Configura&ccedil;&otilde;es</span>\n      </aside>\n\n      <div class=\"dash-main\">\n\n        <div class=\"dash-kpis\">\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Faturamento total</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$184,209</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 28.6%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T22@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Lucro l&iacute;quido</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$47,263</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 18.7%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T23@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Fluxo de caixa</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$23,156</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 21.3%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T24@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Valor do estoque</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$96,147</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 16.4%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T25@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- profit chart -->\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <span class=\"panel-title\">Vis&atilde;o geral do lucro</span>\n            <span class=\"panel-link\">&Uacute;ltimos 30 dias</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"chart-value\">\n            <b>$47,263</b><span>↑ 18.7%</span><em>vs m&ecirc;s anterior</em>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"chart-legend\">\n            <span><i style=\"background:#3B82F6\"></i>Faturamento</span>\n            <span><i style=\"background:#8B3BF1\"></i>Lucro</span>\n          </div>\n          <svg class=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tend&ecirc;ncia de faturamento e lucro nos &uacute;ltimos 30 dias\">\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"14\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"14\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"42\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"42\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"70\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"70\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"98\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"98\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"126\"/>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"17\">$80K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"45\">$60K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"73\">$40K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"101\">$20K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"12\" y=\"129\">$0</text>\n            <path class=\"area-a\" d=\"@@T26@@\"/>\n            <path class=\"area-b\" d=\"@@T27@@\"/>\n            <path class=\"series-a\" d=\"@@T28@@\"/>\n            <path class=\"series-b\" d=\"@@T29@@\"/>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"30\"  y=\"142\">1 mai</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"130\" y=\"142\">8 mai</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"235\" y=\"142\">15 mai</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"340\" y=\"142\">22 mai</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"424\" y=\"142\">29 mai</text>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- right column -->\n        <div style=\"display:grid;gap:8px;align-content:start;min-width:0\">\n\n          <div class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-head\"><span class=\"panel-title\">Sa&uacute;de do estoque</span></div>\n            <div class=\"donut-wrap\">\n              <div class=\"donut-meta\">\n                <b>42</b>\n                <span>dias de estoque</span>\n                <span class=\"status\"><i class=\"dot dot--green\"></i>Saud&aacute;vel</span>\n              </div>\n              <svg class=\"donut\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"42 dias de estoque, saud&aacute;vel\">\n                <circle class=\"track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\"/>\n                <circle class=\"value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" stroke-dasharray=\"176 251\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-head\">\n              <span class=\"panel-title\">Alertas</span>\n              <span class=\"panel-link\">Ver tudo</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alerts\">\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-red\"><svg><use href=\"#i-warn\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Risco de estoque</b><span>3 produtos abaixo de 14 dias</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-amber\"><svg><use href=\"#i-dollar\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Pagamento a fornecedor</b><span>$12,500 vence em 7 dias</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-green\"><svg><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Oportunidade de campanha</b><span>Aumente o or&ccedil;amento em 6 palavras-chave</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-blue\"><svg><use href=\"#i-box\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Reposi&ccedil;&atilde;o recomendada</b><span>8 produtos para repor</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- top products -->\n        <div class=\"panel dash-table-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <span class=\"panel-title\">Principais produtos</span>\n            <span class=\"panel-link\">Ver tudo</span>\n          </div>\n          <table class=\"dash-table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Produto</th><th>Faturamento</th><th>Lucro</th><th>Margem</th>\n                <th>Estoque</th><th>Previs&atilde;o</th><th>Status</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Moedor de Caf&eacute; Port&aacute;til</span></td>\n                <td>$23,590</td><td>$8,612</td><td>30.1%</td><td>486</td><td>42 dias</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--green\"><i class=\"dot dot--green\"></i>Saud&aacute;vel</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Prensa Francesa de A&ccedil;o Inox</span></td>\n                <td>$24,680</td><td>$7,415</td><td>30.0%</td><td>352</td><td>35 dias</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--green\"><i class=\"dot dot--green\"></i>Saud&aacute;vel</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Forros de Silicone para Air Fryer</span></td>\n                <td>$19,230</td><td>$6,192</td><td>32.2%</td><td>215</td><td>28 dias</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--amber\"><i class=\"dot dot--amber\"></i>Estoque baixo</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Balan&ccedil;a Digital de Cozinha</span></td>\n                <td>$15,340</td><td>$4,910</td><td>32.0%</td><td>120</td><td>16 dias</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--amber\"><i class=\"dot dot--amber\"></i>Estoque baixo</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Espumador de Leite Port&aacute;til</span></td>\n                <td>$12,550</td><td>$3,735</td><td>29.1%</td><td>74</td><td>12 dias</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--red\"><i class=\"dot dot--red\"></i>Risco</span></td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     PIPELINE\n==================================================================== -->\n<!-- =====================================================================\n     AMAZEBASE — se&ccedil;&atilde;o de pipeline &ldquo;Um s&oacute; espa&ccedil;o de trabalho. Todas as decis&otilde;es.&rdquo;\n     AUTOCONTIDA. Cole este bloco inteiro no lugar da\n     <section class=\"pipeline\">...</section> existente e apague aquela.\n\n     · Todo o CSS &eacute; inline e fica sob o namespace .abp-* — ele n&atilde;o colide com\n       nenhuma folha de estilo existente, nem &eacute; afetado por ela.\n     · Os 7 &iacute;cones est&atilde;o embutidos como data URIs. Sem arquivos de imagem, sem caminhos para corrigir.\n     · N&atilde;o depende de nada: nenhuma vari&aacute;vel CSS do seu tema, nenhum sprite, nenhuma\n       biblioteca JS. A Inter &eacute; usada se estiver presente; sen&atilde;o, a fonte de interface do sistema.\n\n     PARA REDIMENSIONAR: altere as vari&aacute;veis no bloco RESIZE abaixo. Nada mais\n     precisa ser recalculado — os v&atilde;os na moldura se medem sozinhos.\n===================================================================== -->\n<section class=\"abp\">\n<style>@@T2@@</style>\n\n  <div class=\"abp-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"abp-box\">\n      <span class=\"abp-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i></span>\n      <h2 class=\"abp-title\">Um s&oacute; espa&ccedil;o de trabalho. Todas as decis&otilde;es.</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"abp-rail\">\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:9.293%;width:9.986%;background:#4E94F8!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:23.579%;width:9.986%;background:#669EF9!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:37.864%;width:9.986%;background:#7C7CF7!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:52.150%;width:9.986%;background:#9A57F7!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:66.436%;width:9.986%;background:#C451F3!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:80.721%;width:9.986%;background:#E0479A!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:14.286%;background:#3B82F6!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:28.571%;background:#60A5FA!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:42.857%;background:#8B5CF6!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:57.143%;background:#A855F7!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:71.429%;background:#D946EF!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:85.714%;background:#EC4899!important\"></span>\n\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T4@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Pesquisa</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T5@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Lan&ccedil;amento</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T6@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Estoque</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T7@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Fornecedores</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T8@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Publicidade</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T9@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Fluxo de caixa</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T10@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Lucro</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"abp-caption\">Todos os seus dados. Conectados. Em tempo real.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<script>@@T1@@</script>\n</section>\n<!-- ================= end AmazeBase pipeline section ================= -->\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     COMPARE\n==================================================================== -->\n<!-- =====================================================================\n     AMAZEBASE — se&ccedil;&atilde;o VS &ldquo;A maioria dos vendedores faz malabarismo com ferramentas demais.&rdquo;\n     AUTOCONTIDA. Cole este bloco inteiro no lugar da\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"compare\">...</section> existente e apague aquela.\n\n     · O CSS &eacute; inline e fica sob o namespace .abc-* — n&atilde;o colide com as suas folhas de estilo.\n     · Os logos est&atilde;o embutidos como data URIs. Sem arquivos de imagem, sem caminhos para corrigir.\n     · O diagrama de cada cart&atilde;o &eacute; UM SVG, ent&atilde;o as linhas de conex&atilde;o e aquilo\n       para que elas apontam compartilham um &uacute;nico espa&ccedil;o de coordenadas. As linhas chegam\n       ao alvo por constru&ccedil;&atilde;o, n&atilde;o por ajuste fino. A vers&atilde;o antiga desenhava as linhas num\n       viewBox 400x260 com preserveAspectRatio em none enquanto posicionava os\n       chips separadamente em porcentagens — dois sistemas de coordenadas que nunca foram\n       conciliados, e &eacute; por isso que nada se conectava.\n\n     PARA REDIMENSIONAR: altere as vari&aacute;veis no bloco RESIZE. Nada mais.\n===================================================================== -->\n<section class=\"abc\" id=\"compare\">\n<style>@@T3@@</style>\n\n  <div class=\"abc-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"abc-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"abc-card abc-card--bad\">\n        <h3>A maioria dos vendedores faz malabarismo com ferramentas demais.</h3>\n        <div class=\"abc-stage\">\n          <svg class=\"abc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 210\" role=\"img\"\n               aria-label=\"Oito ferramentas desconectadas, ligadas por linhas pontilhadas interrompidas\">\n      <path class=\"abc-dash\" d=\"M83,44 Q147,58 210,37\"/>\n      <path class=\"abc-dash\" d=\"M210,37 Q264,20 317,41\"/>\n